+Added the ``sqlite`` minion data cache backend (:mod:`salt.cache.sqlite_cache <salt.cache.sqlite_cache>`), which stores cached grains, mine data, and job returns in a single on-disk SQLite database file using only the ``sqlite3`` module from the Python standard library. Data persists across master restarts. Enable with ``cache: sqlite`` on the master; no additional service or package is required.
